<Positioned left="566" top="510" width="438" height="16">
<Text color="#3D4654FF" fontSize="11.0" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono">
<![CDATA[类型标注（CDATA 处理 < > & 与引号）]]>
</Text>
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="566" top="532" width="438" height="114">
<Text color="#3D4654FF" fontSize="10.5" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono">
<Raw>
<![CDATA[from anvilplot import Plot, Series
def overlay(xs: list[float], ys: list[float]) -> Plot:
    # 同时给上下界，避免 & 与 < 直接写在属性里
    assert len(xs) == len(ys) and xs
    return Plot().line(xs, ys).band("p10", "p90")]]>
</Raw>
</Text>
</Positioned>
